The function is already minimal; I hoisted the profile pointer into a local and added a likely branch hint on the valid path so the compiler lays out the hot decode path as fall-through with the zero-return out of line.

```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumComponents(void) const
{
    const auto* p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p != NULL && profileIndex < p->numFields, 1))
        return p->fields[profileIndex].numComponents;
    return 0;
}
```